-- exah-waterkloof-park (researched)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'EXAH is a Salesforce and MuleSoft consulting and implementation partner based in Waterkloof, Pretoria, with a second office in Stellenbosch and clients across Africa, the Middle East and Europe in sectors including fintech, healthcare, consumer goods and manufacturing. Founded in 2014, the firm built its practice around Marketing, Sales, FinTech, Customer Service and Commerce solutions on the Salesforce platform, growing to around 40 staff.

