The business describes itself as supplying glass to people rather than buildings, and emphasises direct interaction with clients to get each job made to their specific requirements. Rathusa Glass & Aluminium, based in East Lynne, Pretoria, trades Monday to Friday from 8am to 4:30pm, and its mix of residential custom glazing and larger institutional housing project work suits both homeowners and government-linked contractors needing glass and aluminium fitted to a precise specification.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.rathusa.co.za/about'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'rathusa-glass-and-aluminium-east-lynne' AND description = 'Rathusa Glass & Aluminium has worked in the glass and aluminium industry for 14 years and is a member of the South African Glazing and Glaziers Association (SAGGA), adhering to the industry''s code of conduct. It supplies and installs windows and doors including uPVC, steel, wooden and aluminium windows, double glazed and sliding or folding doors, and has done extensive glazing work on RDP and GAP housing projects as well as for government institutions.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
